<LegalLayout title="Referral Terms" description="Apna Galla Referral Terms" lastUpdated="October 9, 2026">
  <p>The Apna Galla Referral Program allows registered users to earn rewards by referring other businesses to the platform.</p>
  
  <h2>1. Eligibility</h2>
  <p>You must have an active Apna Galla account to participate in the referral program. Referrals must be new users who have not previously created an account.</p>
  
  <h2>2. Rewards</h2>
  <p>Rewards are granted only after the referred user successfully completes their trial and pays for their first subscription month. Apna Galla reserves the right to modify the reward amount at any time.</p>
  
  <h2>3. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
  <p>You may not spam, use deceptive practices, or create fake accounts to generate referrals. Doing so will result in immediate termination of your account and forfeiture of any pending rewards.</p>
</LegalLayout>
